WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:06.076
Run the Internet Access checks: the two
bypasses fail, and the QUIC check passes

3
00:00:06.076 --> 00:00:11.050
on the interim block, with the preview's
GCC state written into the finding.

4
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.622
Then the TLS checks: the
certificate fails on both counts,

5
00:00:14.622 --> 00:00:17.815
the pinned payroll site's
bypass is the expired one,

6
00:00:17.815 --> 00:00:22.375
and the failure share is one and a half
percent against a threshold of one.

7
00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:25.326
Two weeks later the
certificate has been rolled,

8
00:00:25.326 --> 00:00:29.300
the bypasses renewed and approved,
and all thirteen checks pass.
